== Effects ==
* Upon use, has a roughly 60% chance to drop a [[coin|penny, nickel, or dime]].
** {{dlc|a+nr}} The exact chances are 50% for a penny, 5% for a nickel, 1% for a dime and 44% for nothing.
** {{dlc|r}} The exact chances are 52% for a penny, 6% for a nickel, 2% for a dime and 40% for nothing.

== Notes ==
* This is a starting item for {{C|Keeper}} after he beats {{E|Isaac}}.
* {{dlc|a+}} Sticky nickels and lucky pennies cannot be generated.
* {{Dlc|r}} The item only costs 10 coins when found in a {{r|Shop}}.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|9 Volt}}: Allows for infinite generation of coins in a room with enemies.
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns tiny coin wisps in the middle ring. The wisps have a 50% chance to drop a random [[coin]] when destroyed.}}
* {{i|Car Battery}}: Two independent attempts of generating a coin, which can be of different values.

